{"id": "63178", "title": "地水鸾宫明月姬", "author": "桂圆八宝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 75, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63178.htm", "intro": "一个让人笑到了哭的故事，一个立志要做好人的坏女孩的传奇——如果街上碰到一个男人，看上的他的几率是百分之一，出手抢到他的几率是百分之一，他是皇帝的几率……好吧，我们也算百分之一，那么明月姬不小心就把这百分之三占全了。所以剩下的百分之九十七，人生离合，世事悲欢，也就没什么好稀奇了——", "base": "files/article/html/63/63178", "chapters": [{"title": "走吧，我们去春游", "file": "9354373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "其实我们是来借钱的", "file": "9354380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "贼有钱", "file": "9354382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二合一，真无敌", "file": "9354383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "美丽的人儿喂鱼了", "file": "9354384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "咦呀咦吱呦", "file": "9354385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "人穷志短马不跑", "file": "9354386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "9354387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "9354389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "9354391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "9354393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再……再喂一次鱼", "file": "9354395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "9354396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我是勤劳的小蜜蜂", "file": "9354399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "9354400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "聚众赌博，罚款一文", "file": "9354404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 17 章", "file": "9354410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 18 章", "file": "9354414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "流年", "file": "9354416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 20 章", "file": "9354417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温泉乡大作战", "file": "9354419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 22 章", "file": "9354421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 23 章", "file": "9354423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 24 章", "file": "9354425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 25 章", "file": "9354426.html", "availa